{
  "_comment": "TACO (Trash Annotations in Context, CC BY 4.0, http://tacodataset.org) categories merged into the classes our litter model is trained on. Each class maps to a taxonomy item in eco_verify.json. TACO categories not listed here (cigarettes, tissues, straws, broken glass, caps, unlabeled litter...) are left out of training.",
  "min_instances": 15,
  "_trust_comment": "trust false = trained on (helps the model tell materials apart) but ignored at run time: on held-out close-ups these classes gave more wrong materials than right ones (ecoverify/train/closeup_eval.py). COCO + CLIP handle them instead.",
